### Page 1 of 5

```text
MEMORANDUM
TO:

Mayor Patrick Collins, and City Council
FROM:

TJ Barttelbort, Purchasing Manager
DATE:

April 4, 2023
SUBJECT:
Consideration of Bid #S-18-23 for an Agreement between the City of
Cheyenne and S & S Builders, LLC for the Greater Cheyenne Greenway,
Greenway Commons Retaining Wall Re-Construction
_____________________________________________
Bid #S-18-23 was solicited for the Greater Cheyenne Greenway, Greenway Commons Retaining
Wall Re-Construction project.  A project vicinity map is included for reference.

Two (2) bidders responded to this bid, and the bid tabulation is attached.

The Bids were received from:
1. S & S Builders LLC.  Cheyenne, Wyoming.
2. Reiman Corp.  Cheyenne, Wyoming.

The bids were reviewed by Jeanie Vetter (Planning & Development), Jason Sanchez (Community
Recreation & Events), and Darci Hendon (Summit Engineering), and their recommendation is to
accept the lowest responsive bid from S & S Builders LLC.

The Bid Award amount is requested for $153,155.00.

Funding:
030-17-1754-45-43416 (2017 Special Purpose Option Tax / Greenway Maintenance)
032-17-1754-45-43416 (2021 Special Purpose Option Tax / Greenway Maintenance)
```

